      hu: ["A félsziget legszűkebb pontján kevesebb mint 3 kilométer széles.", "Icacos faluja Trinidad legdélnyugatibb lakott települése.", "A partmenti erózió évente több méternyi szárazföldet emészt fel.", "A kókuszolaj-termelés több mint 100 évig volt a fő bevételi forrás.", "A régióban több aktív iszapvulkán is található.", "Tiszta időben Venezuela partjai szabad szemmel is jól láthatók innen."],
      ro: ["Peninsula are o lățime de sub 3 km în cel mai îngust punct al său.", "Icacos reprezintă cel mai sud-vestic punct al insulei Trinidad.", "Eroziunea costieră distruge anual câțiva metri din suprafața terestră.", "Producția de ulei de cocos a fost principala activitate timp de un secol.", "În regiune se află mai mulți vulcani noroioși activi.", "Coasta Venezuelei este clar vizibilă în zilele senine de pe țărm."],
      en: ["The peninsula is less than 3 km wide at its narrowest point.", "Icacos Point marks the southwesternmost extremity of Trinidad.", "Coastal erosion claims several meters of land annually in this region.", "Coconut oil production was the mainstay of the economy for over a century.", "Several mud volcanoes are located throughout the peninsula's interior.", "The Venezuelan coast is clearly visible from the shoreline on clear days."],
